Important finding for R7 (el-segmented unreachable): GraphToolbar is inside `<template v-if="!isErrorState && state !== 'loading'">` (index.vue:9). So when the page is in error state (which is the default first-screen state due to P1 timeout), the toolbar — including el-segmented — is NOT rendered. Hence `document.querySelector('.el-segmented')` returns null in the repro. So the "unreachable" is a consequence of the error state, not a bug in el-segmented itself. But ALSO: during loading state it's not rendered either. In a healthy session, el-segmented would render. So R7 = 无问题 as an independent bug; it's explained by P1. The "模式切换控件自动化不可达" is a symptom of the error panel, not a separate defect. However — the repro v3 was mode switching... they may have been in error state. Given error panel blocks toolbar, the automation failure is explained. So verdict: 无独立问题（由 P1 错误态导致）；但有个二阶问题——错误面板把工具栏整个隐藏，用户连切换模式的机会都没有，只能"重试/重置"，reset goes back to overview which times out again → dead loop. That's actually a real UX problem worth noting (medium).

